- [acc-intentions-070] Physical Infrastructure as Competitive Moat: While physical infrastructure is crucial, an over-reliance on it as a competitive moat risks underestimating the continued importance of algorithmic innovation, talent acquisition, and novel business models, which could allow agile competitors to bypass or disrupt infrastructure-heavy incumbents through superior software or service offerings.
